    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>The source of your powers is the result of your hard work, dedication, and long hours.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.CjqhY7vBfkJQyhw4]{Gadgets}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.1xx6Rm1oWVEf7cuY]{Always Be Prepared}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.irLsZNE2hqDWW3B6]{Reactive Field}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.CBzx0lk7CrKoKXJP]{Flowing Fight}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Additional Info</div><p>When you move to the next step, select an extra quality from that archetype's list at d8.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d10, d8, d8 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
